rson","person_id":"s74_0jk_msn","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m034-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"召公","kind":"person","person_id":"s74_0jk_msn","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m034-0341","start":341,"end":343,"surface":"厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"jps_m3k_hu4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m034-0344","start":344,"end":346,"surface":"厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"jps_m3k_hu4","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p035","text":"厲王太子靜匿召公之家，國人聞之，乃圍之。召公曰：「昔吾驟諫王，王不從，以及此難也。今殺王太子，王其以我為讎而懟怒乎？夫事君者，險而不讎懟，怨而不怒，況事王乎！」乃以其子代王太子，太子竟得脫。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m035-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"jps_m3k_hu4","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m035-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"太子靜","kind":"person","person_id":"lt5_gcv_iqh","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m035-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"召公","kind":"person","person_id":"s74_0jk_msn","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m035-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"召公","kind":"person","person_id":"s74_0jk_msn","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m035-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"其子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、官號或文字疑讀；保留錨點，不補熟知姓名或假定同指。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p036","text":"召公、周公二相行政，號曰「共和」。共和十四年，厲王死于彘。太子靜長於召公家，二相乃共立之為王，是為宣王。宣王即位，二相輔之，修政，法文、武、成、康之遺風，諸侯復宗周。十二年，魯武公來朝。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m036-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"召公","kind":"person","person_id":"s74_0jk_msn","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m036-0003","start":3,"end":5,"s